// Where recording's metered audio seconds come from, daily (OBS-5). AI usage.
//
// Measure: recording jobs whose Speech usage was recorded, by the source of the duration.
// Formula: sum(valueSum) of transcription.speech.usage.jobs per day, by
//   speech.audio_duration_source: azure (the duration in Azure's results file, what it
//   bills on), estimate (the duration given when the job was submitted), or none
//   (neither known: nothing recorded on hmcts.speech.audio.duration).
// Source: the counter transcription.speech.usage.jobs, one per succeeded recording job
//   (Speech batch mode only: dictation uploads always have Azure's duration). The
//   metric is recording's own, so it needs no area filter (metrics carry no hmcts.area).
// Caveats: a high share of estimate or none makes the batch audio hours, and any
//   allocation of cost by them, less exact.
customMetrics
| where name == "transcription.speech.usage.jobs"
| extend source = tostring(customDimensions["speech.audio_duration_source"])
| summarize jobs = sum(valueSum) by timestamp = bin(timestamp, 1d), source
| order by timestamp asc, source asc
